# api-streaming-guardrails

> **Purpose:** Keep the live demo stable and cheap.
>
> **Applies to:** `apps/api/src/**`

## SSE
- Set SSE headers and flush them at once.
- Send the run snapshot first, then live events.
- Send a heartbeat comment every 15 seconds.
- End the stream after `run.done` or `run.error`.
- Stop writing when the client disconnects.
- Write events only through the `sendSseEvent` util.

## Guardrails
- Rate-limit `POST /api/runs` and `POST /api/guides/:slug/reports` per IP.
- Enforce `DAILY_RUN_CAP` before a run starts.
- Allow CORS only from `WEB_ORIGIN`.
- Put a timeout on every external call (`withTimeout`).

## Logging
- Log in a structured format with the run ID.
- Never log secrets or full page text.
